==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.|en}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|حَبَشَة}}, from {{m|ar|حَبَش||Abysinnian}}.<ref name=AHD>{{R:American Heritage 1971|page=6}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˌæb.ɪˈsɪn.i.ə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌæb.ɪˈsɪn.i.ə/|/ˌæb.əˈsɪn.i.ə/|/ˌæb.əˈsɪn.jə/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪniə|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪnjə|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{context|dated|lang=en}} [[historical|Historical]] name of [[Ethiopia]].

